{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39117","headline":"寄薛先辈 · 韦庄","name":"寄薛先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悬知回日彩衣荣，仙籍高标第一名。\n瑶树带风侵物冷，玉山和雨射人清。\n龙翻瀚海波涛壮，鹤出金笼燕雀惊。\n不说文章与门地，自然毛骨是公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}